            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mary"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Big hit just changed out the lettuce for fat free retried beans and used fat free Greek yogurt instead of the sour cream . And instead of fresh jalapeños in the mixture, put jarred jalapeños on top (so that picky eaters could easily avoid them or pick them off). Thanks for the great recipe.",
