            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jean"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was greeted by oohs and aahs as our Thanksgiving appetizer. I put one Tbsp. of chili powder, 1/2 tsp cumin, 1/2 tsp salt (for the taco seasoning). I included all the seeds with the jalapeno and all other ingredients as listed. It was plenty \"spicy\" and had a heat that grows. I used Garlic Tabasco for the red pepper sauce. I will make it again, and probably in a similar way.",
            "datePublished": "2017-11-24T03:01:42.657Z"
          },
